jumpTest is test
jumpTest purpose "setjmp gives 0, longjmp brings it back with the value (and 1 for 0), with memory written in between kept"
jumpTest verifies saveJump keepsPlace
jumpTest verifies jump comesBack
jumpTest typeParameter none
jumpTest input none
jumpTest output none
jumpTest outputOwnedBy none
jumpTest raises none
jumpTest effect use machine.memory
