jumpTest label second loopKind none
jumpTest label second within none
jumpTest label third loopKind none
jumpTest label third within none
jumpTest let n512 Int64 512 immutable
jumpTest let eight Int64 8 immutable
jumpTest let one Int64 1 immutable
jumpTest let int320 Int32 0 immutable
jumpTest let int327 Int32 7 immutable
jumpTest let int321 Int32 1 immutable
jumpTest let two Int64 2 immutable
